    "replace_to": "https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app",
    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"What our patients say\",\"title\":\"Circumcision Reviews \\u0026 Patient Testimonials\",\"lede\":\"Choosing where to have a circumcision is an important decision.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Testimonials\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Many of the babies, children and adults we see at Beverley Clinic come to us following a recommendation from a family member, friend or previous patient.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We are grateful to the thousands of patients and parents who have taken the time to share their experiences of our clinic through Google, Trustpilot, Yell, video testimonials and feedback sent directly to us.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Below you can read and watch some of their experiences.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book an appointment</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"independent-reviews\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"independent-reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Independent Reviews of Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"eyebrow\":\"What our patients and parents say\",\"lede\":\"Read our latest independently published reviews.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Google\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read more Google reviews\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\\u0026query=Beverley+Clinic+Edgware\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"},{\"title\":\"Yell\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read more Yell reviews\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://www.yell.com/biz/circumcision-in-london-edgware-6864473/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"why-patients-choose-us\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"why-patients-choose-us\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Why Patients Choose Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"Every patient and family has their own reasons for choosing a circumcision clinic, but there are several themes that appear repeatedly in the feedback we receive.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Circumcision is a core part of our clinical work\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe perform circumcision regularly for babies, toddlers, children, teenagers and adults.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur practitioners have extensive experience of circumcision and have also trained doctors from the UK and abroad in safe circumcision techniques.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Clear explanations before the procedure\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePatients and parents frequently tell us how important it was to understand what would happen before the circumcision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide preparation information before treatment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Care for all ages\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision from infancy through childhood and adolescence to adulthood.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe technique used is selected according to the patient\\u0026#039;s age, anatomy and individual circumstances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Support does not finish when you leave the clinic\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePatients receive written aftercare information and guidance following their procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe make a next-day telephone call and provide follow-up during healing where required.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Recommendations from other families\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA significant proportion of our patients come through word-of-mouth recommendations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe also regularly see families return to us for another son or recommend the clinic to relatives and friends.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Independent patient feedback\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eRather than asking visitors simply to take our word for it, we encourage prospective patients and parents to read independent reviews and make their own decision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/about/\">About Beverley Clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/\">Meet our practitioners</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"selected-testimonials\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"selected-testimonials\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Selected Patient Testimonials\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"A small selection of written feedback from patients and parents who have attended Beverley Clinic.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/quotes-grid {\"quotes\":[{\"name\":\"Mustafa Butt\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision\",\"quote\":\"We recently took our 3-week-old son to Beverley Clinic, and it was an incredibly positive experience. From the moment we arrived, the receptionist was very welcoming and clearly explained the procedure, which helped put us at ease.\\n\\nWhen the doctor called us in, he was thorough and professional, explaining everything he was going to do beforehand. Throughout the procedure, he remained calm and reassuring, making the experience stress-free. He also took the time to explain the aftercare in detail, which was very helpful.\\n\\nWe were very impressed with the clinic’s professionalism and care and would definitely recommend this place to others.\"},{\"name\":\"Daniel - 35 years old\",\"context\":\"Adult circumcision\",\"quote\":\"Brilliant.\\n\\nDr Ali \\u0026 his team have a truly professional approach, with clear explanation, making you feel very welcome \\u0026 comfortable.\\n\\nI was a little nervous as anyone would be, but it was soon clear to me I had made the right choice.\\n\\nI experienced no pain at any time; the whole experience was just 75 minutes \\u0026 I am delighted with the end result.\\n\\nI would certainly recommend Dr Ali to anyone considering a circumcision or a related issue.\"},{\"name\":\"Phimosis sufferer - 29 years old\",\"context\":\"Medical circumcision\",\"quote\":\"I'm quite squeamish and had put off having a circumcision due to phimosis (tight foreskin) for some time.\\n\\nThe operation itself was mainly pain-free, nothing to worry about, and I have healed very nicely.\\n\\nDr Al-Ali was excellent, professional and friendly. As far as i could tell he is very skilled at what he does, and i think it's worth visiting someone like him who specialises in circumcision.I haven't had the need to attend a follow up as everything seems fine.\\n\\nThanks to Dr Al-Ali and his assistant Mohammed, who was also great.\"},{\"name\":\"Dean J\",\"context\":\"Re-circumcision\",\"quote\":\"I'd like to feedback my experience on my re-circumcision by Dr.Al-Ali in September 2010.  The process was easy, no pain at all, even the injection was almost pain-free, and throughout the procedure I felt no discomfort.  The healing took only 10-12 days with the dissolvable stitches finally all coming out on the 15th day leave a scar that is almost invisible. The end result has surpassed my expectations completely with the shaft skin now being smooth and wrinkle free and the old scar completely removed.  I can honestly say that it is as close to perfection that I can have imagined. I would heartily recommend Dr Al-Ali to anyone either for an initial circumcision or 're-do' but would stress two things that need to be done prior. Firstly know what you want the result to be, tight/loose,  high/low, etc and be honest when answering any questions, if you have a piercings say so - it does make a difference.  I most certainly will be shouting out to anyone just how excellent the service and standards of Dr Al-Ali.  Thank you so very much\"},{\"name\":\"Sara Salmanpour\",\"context\":\"Parent feedback\",\"quote\":\"We recently took our 2-month-old son to Beverley Clinic for his circumcision, and the experience was absolutely exceptional. As first-time parents, we were naturally anxious, but the team at the clinic made us feel completely at ease from the moment we walked in.\\n\\nThe clinic was spotless and well-organized, and the staff were incredibly kind and professional. The doctor explained the procedure in detail and addressed all of our concerns with patience and clarity. Their calm demeanor and expertise reassured us that our baby was in safe hands.\\n\\nThe procedure itself was quick and efficient, and the doctor provided clear aftercare instructions. They also gave us the option to contact them anytime if we had questions, which was a huge relief.\\n\\nI cannot recommend Beverley Clinic enough for parents looking for a trustworthy and professional place for their child’s circumcision. Their care and attention to detail truly exceeded our expectations.\"},{\"name\":\"Wajahat Murtaza\",\"context\":\"Parent feedback\",\"quote\":\"I had my son’s circumcision done 2 weeks ago and the process was smooth and efficient. The receptionist was very kind and welcoming and gave us all the information we needed. Dr Haider is very professional and experienced. We were given all the information and a follow up call was made as well which is a nice thing to do. Ring came off after a week and my son is doing well. Highly recommended.\"}],\"perPage\":0,\"showStars\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"video-testimonials\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"video-testimonials\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Video Testimonials\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"eyebrow\":\"Hear directly from our patients and parents\",\"lede\":\"Some patients and parents have kindly agreed to share their experience of Beverley Clinic on video.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>These testimonials provide an opportunity to hear directly from people who have attended the clinic and learn about their experience before, during and after circumcision.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/video-grid {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 1\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-4542.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-4542.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 2\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-4557.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-4557.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 3\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-4799.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-4799.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 4\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-5411.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-5411.jpg\"}],\"showHead\":false,\"layout\":\"cards\"} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/video-testimonials/\">Watch more video testimonials</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"make-your-own-decision\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"make-your-own-decision\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-2\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-2\">Read the Reviews. Ask Questions. Make Your Own Decision.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We understand that choosing a circumcision clinic involves trust.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We encourage you to read our Google, Trustpilot and Yell reviews, watch our video testimonials and look through feedback from patients and parents before deciding whether Beverley Clinic is right for you or your child.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you have questions before booking, please contact us.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons cil-consultation-buttons-grid\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons cil-consultation-buttons-grid\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book an appointment</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">Contact us</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/\">View circumcision prices</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything\",\"formId\":\"testimonials\",\"subject\":\"testimonials page enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->",
